{% comment %}
  Why we give results, but you fail — Instant-style truth check for Orange.
{% endcomment %}
<section class="lx-truth" id="lx-truth" aria-labelledby="lx-truth-title">
  <div class="lx-truth__inner">
    <p class="lx-truth__eyebrow">Truth check</p>
    <h2 class="lx-truth__title" id="lx-truth-title">Why we give results, but you fail</h2>
    <p class="lx-truth__lede">
      Most people fail on generic templates and gym myths. We build customised plans on science and coach principles.
    </p>
    <div class="lx-truth__grid">
      <article class="lx-truth__card lx-truth__card--fail">
        <p class="lx-truth__label">Why people fail</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Generic AI plans copy the same template for everyone</li>
          <li>Old beliefs like “more sweat means more fat loss”</li>
          <li>Random YouTube workouts with no weekly structure</li>
          <li>Crash diets that crash your energy and adherence</li>
          <li>Ignoring sleep, water, and recovery</li>
          <li>Changing plans every week before results can show</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article class="lx-truth__card lx-truth__card--win">
        <p class="lx-truth__label">Why our plans work</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Personal workout and diet built from your assessment</li>
          <li>Science first: calories, protein, progressive overload, recovery</li>
          <li>Weekly check-ins and 1-to-1 coach chat</li>
          <li>Daily trackers so we can see what is actually happening</li>
          <li>Plan updates when you stall — not a static PDF</li>
          <li>Built for your schedule, gym or home, veg or mixed diet</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .lx-truth {
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15)),
      #070707;
    color: #fff;
    padding: 40px 18px 48px;
    border-block: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .lx-truth__inner {
    max-width: 920px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .lx-truth__eyebrow {
    margin: 0;
    color: #ff6200;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .lx-truth__title {
    margin: 8px 0 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 4vw, 2.4rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.15;
  }
  .lx-truth__lede {
    margin: 10px 0 0;
    max-width: 38rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .lx-truth__grid {
    margin-top: 22px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .lx-truth__card {
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 20px 18px;
    background: #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28);
  }
  .lx-truth__card--fail {
    border: 2px solid #e11d48;
  }
  .lx-truth__card--win {
    border: 2px solid #16a34a;
  }
  .lx-truth__label {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .lx-truth__card--fail .lx-truth__label {
    color: #e11d48;
  }
  .lx-truth__card--win .lx-truth__label {
    color: #16a34a;
  }
  .lx-truth__card ul {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .lx-truth__card li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 18px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: #1c1917;
  }
  .lx-truth__card li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.45em;
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .lx-truth__card--fail li::before {
    background: #e11d48;
  }
  .lx-truth__card--win li::before {
    background: #16a34a;
  }
  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .lx-truth {
      padding: 48px 24px 56px;
    }
    .lx-truth__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 14px;
    }
  }
</style>
